        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-SVY875010SBR, Decorative 10 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull is available in a wide array of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, black, and polished brass. It has a 10 inch overall length and 7 inch mounting centers. This decorative refrigerator pull is supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4 inch - 1 inch thick panels which is the standard appliance panel thickness.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST03-specifications.gif?v=1704354609\" width=\"562\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions SVY875010SBR Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in longer version: <a href=\"/products/17-inch-castle-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-svy875017sbr\"><b>Decorative 17 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the FII-AP-SVY875010SBR Castle Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST03-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions AP-SVY875010SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
