                "description": "The 10 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull is available in a wide array of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, black, and polished brass. It has a 10 inch overall length and 7 inch mounting centers. This decorative refrigerator pull is supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4 inch - 1 inch thick panels which is the standard appliance panel thickness.\r\n",
